    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Sabeline Nock</strong> is a small, very neat sentient skeleton, contracted Exchange staff, who keeps the night copy of the custody ledger in the night custody office. Quiet, exact and faintly amused, she taps four slow with her pen when she thinks and never raises her voice; she lowers it.</p><p><strong>GM notes (Part 7).</strong> [SECRET] She runs the Thaw day to day (Quill is its cause): she found Cladis's open claim while copying it forward. She drives T5 (The Outstanding Tag: Investigation or History DC 12, then Pringus's public audit) and approaches the party herself in Scene 3B if Quill's test fails. Reassigned to a day desk if Tallis's review goes ahead (7.6, day 2).</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
